{"3418090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death's Legacy", "steam_appid": 3418090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THE DEMO THIS NOVEMBER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE ULTIMATE NECROMANCER ADVENTURE RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death’s Legacy is an open-world action RPG where you rise from death itself to hunt the kingdom that once experimented on you. Master the power of shadows, command an army of revived monsters, and carve your path through a world filled with danger, mystery, and ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting</strong> – Engage in fast-paced combat using a mix of weapons, abilities, and strategy to overcome deadly foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/28e561e94da0f98c87cbf5dc8fae776a.poster.avif?t=1787584927\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/28e561e94da0f98c87cbf5dc8fae776a.webm?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/28e561e94da0f98c87cbf5dc8fae776a.mp4?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning</strong> – Turn defeated enemies into allies who fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/f954691bfd47d84d173aa21a66a2dbd6.poster.avif?t=1787584927\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/f954691bfd47d84d173aa21a66a2dbd6.webm?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/f954691bfd47d84d173aa21a66a2dbd6.mp4?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command</strong> – Direct your summoned allies in battle, combining their unique skills with yours to crush any threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/01c6de732cb109b2ef1cb74218e366b5.poster.avif?t=1787584927\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/01c6de732cb109b2ef1cb74218e366b5.webm?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/01c6de732cb109b2ef1cb74218e366b5.mp4?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Harness the Power of Death </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where each character controls an elemental force like fire, water, earth, or wind, you wield the ultimate power: death. As a necromancer, revive the enemies you vanquish and command an army of the undead. Shape your destiny by mastering dark magic and become the most feared force in the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A Vast World Full of Secrets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an expansive world with varied landscapes and biomes. Encounter mysterious monsters, powerful army generals, and challenge the capital's supremacy with your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A Tale of Vengeance and Necromantic Power </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest for revenge as you seek to overthrow the capital that wronged you. Raise an army of undead minions by defeating and reviving monsters, shaping your path of vengeance with each strategic choice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THE DEMO THIS NOVEMBER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE ULTIMATE NECROMANCER ADVENTURE RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death’s Legacy is an open-world action RPG where you rise from death itself to hunt the kingdom that once experimented on you. Master the power of shadows, command an army of revived monsters, and carve your path through a world filled with danger, mystery, and ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting</strong> – Engage in fast-paced combat using a mix of weapons, abilities, and strategy to overcome deadly foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/28e561e94da0f98c87cbf5dc8fae776a.poster.avif?t=1787584927\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/28e561e94da0f98c87cbf5dc8fae776a.webm?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/28e561e94da0f98c87cbf5dc8fae776a.mp4?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning</strong> – Turn defeated enemies into allies who fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/f954691bfd47d84d173aa21a66a2dbd6.poster.avif?t=1787584927\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/f954691bfd47d84d173aa21a66a2dbd6.webm?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418090/extras/f954691bfd47d84d173aa21a66a2dbd6.mp4?t=1787584927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command</strong> – Direct your summoned allies in battle, combining their unique skills with yours to crush any threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor